{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Harvest Grove Fall Festival is supposed to be a time of autumn delights\u2014hayrides, caramel apples, and the biggest celebration in town. But this year, something\u2019s not right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Someone has been playing pranks all over the\u00a0festival. At first, they were harmless enough, but now, people are getting hurt. And you can't shake the feeling that someone is constantly watching you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As amateur sleuth Marcella Moon, you\u2019ve been called in to uncover the truth before the festival is shut down for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Investigate the Festival</strong> \u2013 Question quirky staff members, explore the festival grounds, and enjoy the halloween festivities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Clues &amp; Solve Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Interrogate suspects, find clues, and piece together the evidence.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Voice-Acted and Animated, Immersive Mystery</strong> \u2013 A cast of colorful characters brings the festival\u2014and its secrets\u2014to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking, and the festival\u2019s 50th anniversary may be its last. Can you solve the mystery before the grand finale? Or will you fall victim to the Phantom of Harvest Grove?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the 6th game in the Marcella Moon point and click mystery series. The games can be played in any order.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong>\u00a0This is a demo featuring the first portion of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_para